{"4806910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Claims & Caverns", "steam_appid": 4806910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4885300], "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806910/extras/28b6db720e55757f3a3d528dbbb6f466.avif?t=1787361599\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806910/extras_big/28b6db720e55757f3a3d528dbbb6f466.webp?t=1787361599 width=1560 height=585 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806910/extras/8e8f3dcf8079609a9f88b9e36cbef23d.avif?t=1787361599\" width=720 height=291 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Claims &amp; Caverns</strong> is a co-operative horror game where you and your friends enter <strong>procedurally generated dwarven mines</strong> as &quot;minecare insurance adjusters&quot; for a predatory insurance provider. Descend into the <strong>cavernous depths</strong>, <strong>gather evidence</strong>, and return to tell the tale... <i>or <strong>die trying</strong></i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806910/extras/810edde2d15e4db1538aa3e8d4f89440.avif?t=1787361599\" width=1280 height=256 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806910/extras/f18eaa95bf951a11816eceed35ddedb9.poster.avif?t=1787361599\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806910/extras/f18eaa95bf951a11816eceed35ddedb9.webm?t=1787361599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806910/extras/f18eaa95bf951a11816eceed35ddedb9.mp4?t=1787361599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together<i> </i>to meet the <strong>evidence quota:</strong> chat over <strong>proximity chat</strong> or fan out and <strong>gather evidence<i> </i></strong><i>synergistically<strong>!</strong></i><strong> </strong>Choose items from the local shop like <strong>lanterns</strong>, <strong>shovels</strong>, and <strong>elf ear communicators</strong> to aid your quest. Items can be thrown at friends and foes to hilarious effect.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806910/extras/2ccc59753542a6dd9d24ed511916d93e.avif?t=1787361599\" width=1280 height=256 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806910/extras/c23028bf3da6447c996ddec6f774ee04.poster.avif?t=1787361599\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806910/extras/c23028bf3da6447c996ddec6f774ee04.webm?t=1787361599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806910/extras/c23028bf3da6447c996ddec6f774ee04.mp4?t=1787361599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delve deep into the caverns to find evidence.</strong> No claim is too small for <i>Miners Mutual: </i>will you gather copious small items near the top of the mine, or go for the most valuable evidence at the bottom to maximize your payout? However you play, make sure to return to the wagon before the evidence quota is due.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806910/extras/421730dd57f29445f28c3e1ff9829c64.avif?t=1787361599\" width=1280 height=256 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll quickly find that visitors are unwelcome. Tread carefully or you might attract the ire of the <strong>spiders</strong>, <strong>crows</strong>, <strong>serpents</strong>, and other horrors that lurk below. Keep your wits about you and you might just survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806910/extras/8e6f963b23c6f3ea7c4ed4f6a4701495.poster.avif?t=1787361599\" width=960 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806910/extras/8e6f963b23c6f3ea7c4ed4f6a4701495.webm?t=1787361599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806910/extras/8e6f963b23c6f3ea7c4ed4f6a4701495.mp4?t=1787361599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806910/extras/4118b95355c308fb74898136c70d0561.avif?t=1787361599\" width=1280 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All evidence must be returned by the specified time. Don't worry, your fallen friends count too.<strong> Will you make it to the end of day 3?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806910/extras/45e2d3bba8ae28550cd64cecf9178653.poster.avif?t=1787361599\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806910/extras/45e2d3bba8ae28550cd64cecf9178653.webm?t=1787361599\" t